  Saturday evening\, run by the Downtown board with Sharing and Caring. Tr
 ick-or-treaters start at The Landing with a canned food donation\, then c
 ollect candy from businesses around downtown before the whole group walks
  together behind the library at 6:30 PM. The night ends with a Thriller d
 ance back at The Landing at 7 PM. There is no ticket\, but organizers ask
  each costumed kid to bring at least two canned or nonperishable food ite
 ms.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Destin & Fort Walton\nTimes: Saturday 10/10 · 4 
